      {
        "key": "rank",
        "name": "生成基础最热榜",
        "kind": "process",
        "description_zh": "对整批CoinGecko候选计算四指标稳健Z交易热度，按当前分数取前20。",
        "description_en": "Rank the current cohort by four-factor robust Z trading heat; top 20.",
        "algorithm_zh": "同批次每项y=ln(1+x)，Z=(y−median(y))/(1.4826×MAD(y))并截断[−3,+3]。热度=0.35×Z(RVOL)+0.25×Z(换手率)+0.20×Z(成交额)+0.20×Z(绝对涨跌幅)。MAD尺度≤1e−12的分项全体0并标注退化，不重分配权重；全部退化不可比较。全精度排序，同分asset_id升序。直接快照排名，不读旧activity_score、不累计或衰减。",
        "algorithm_en": "Within one frozen cohort, transform log1p, center by median and scale by 1.4826 MAD; clip Z to [−3,+3]. Weights: RVOL .35, turnover .25, volume .20, absolute move .20. Degenerate scale ≤1e−12 contributes zero without reweighting; all-degenerate batches are incomparable. Sort full precision, then asset ID. No event accumulation or decay.",
        "trigger_zh": "每5分钟一批；来源≤15分钟，覆盖健康且完整才发布；失败不使用旧榜冒充当前。",
